1
00:00:03,158 --> 00:00:10,718
What your patients see — Patient Portal — The portal from the patient’s side, so you can answer their questions with confidence.

2
00:00:11,261 --> 00:00:16,040
This is not a staff preview. We are signed in as the patient — the portal is their whole app.

3
00:00:16,040 --> 00:00:28,129
The Overview opens on what is next: their upcoming appointment and anything waiting for them.

4
00:00:28,129 --> 00:00:36,932
Patients see their own history and what is booked — which is most of the calls your desk takes.

5
00:00:36,932 --> 00:00:44,750
Diagnoses shows the problem list in plain terms, with the date each was made.

6
00:00:44,750 --> 00:00:52,976
Prescriptions lists what is active, the dose, and how many refills remain.

7
00:00:52,976 --> 00:01:01,467
Records is the visit notes you save in the chart. Write them knowing the patient will read them.

8
00:01:01,467 --> 00:01:11,285
Forms Requested is where intake and consent forms land. Completed here, they arrive back on the chart.

9
00:01:11,388 --> 00:01:26,688
What you just did

10
00:01:27,284 --> 00:01:36,284
Health | Efficiency | Growth — More in the Getting Started series — the next video is linked on screen.
